16:06.223 --> 16:08.122
Yeah? Like what?
Just tap out.

16:08.124 --> 16:10.024
Uh... The classics,
you know?

16:10.026 --> 16:12.761
Going back to the,
uh... Basics, really.

16:12.763 --> 16:14.963
